{"ID": 1228865519071789179, "Timestamp": "2024-04-14 00:32:50", "Contents": "yes. eventually that should crack paul's hash, because his password is within that list; however, duncan's password isn't in that list, and while stilgert's is, you need to specify md5crypt as his algorithm. john doesn't know all that and will only acknowledge that there are more password hashes that have yet to be cracked, therefore it'll parse the list until they are cracked or the end of the list is reached.", "Attachments": ""},
